---
import { company } from "../lib/data";
---
<section class="case-section shell" id="case">
  <div class="case-title"><p class="overline"><span>02</span> CASE FILE</p><h2>一社をずっと<br/>追いかける。</h2><p>制度を科目ごとに覚えるのではなく、「この会社で今なにが起きたか」を基準に知識をつなげます。</p></div>
  <aside class="company-dossier">
    <div class="dossier-head"><div><span class="dossier-id">CASE / KC-001</span><h3>{company.name}</h3><p>{company.description}</p></div><div class="dossier-seal">MODEL<br/>COMPANY</div></div>
    <div class="company-facts">{company.facts.map(f=><div class="company-fact"><span>{f.label}</span><strong>{f.value}</strong></div>)}</div>
  </aside>
</section>
